mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Job[Need async Apex?] --> Q1{Must it run on a clock?}
  Q1 -->|Yes daily or weekly| Sched[Scheduled Apex; kick Batch or Queueable from execute]
  Q1 -->|No, after this save| Q2{How much data?}
  Q2 -->|Millions / QueryLocator maintenance| Batch[Batch Apex]
  Q2 -->|One logical follow-up, maybe chain or sObject state| Q3{New code vs legacy?}
  Q3 -->|New| Qable[Queueable: Salesforce-recommended default]
  Q3 -->|Legacy mixed DML or existing @future| Fut[Future only with a reason]
  Q2 -->|Callout plus complex payload| Qable2[Queueable with callout, not 50 future fan-out]
